-        *   Unit 1: `transferFunctionTexture` (`GL_TEXTURE_1D`) [S1, unofficial].
-        *   Unit 2: `indexFunctionTexture` (`GL_TEXTURE_1D`) [S1, unofficial].
-        *   Unit 3: `styleTransferTexture` (`GL_TEXTURE_2D_ARRAY`) [S1, unofficial].
